---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// RED (service boundary) vs USE (resource pools) around the Todo HTTP service,
// plus why Histogram le buckets merge across pods while Summary quantiles break.
const W = 900;
const H = 408;
---
<figure class="gp17a">
  <div class="gp17a-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: RED metrics sit at the Todo HTTP service boundary measuring Rate, Errors, and Duration, while USE metrics sit inside the pod measuring CPU, memory, and queue saturation. Bottom: two pods expose Histogram le buckets that sum cleanly cluster-wide, whereas pre-computed Summary p99 quantiles cannot be averaged.">
    {/* ---------- Row 1: RED vs USE ---------- */}
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Two lenses around the Todo service: RED at the boundary, USE inside the pod</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Hai góc nhìn quanh Todo service: RED ở cửa request, USE bên trong pod</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Client box */}
    <rect x="20" y="54" width="118" height="72" rx="8" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="users" x={79} y={78} size={28} />
    <text x="79" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Clients</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Người dùng</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Arrow Clients -> RED middleware */}
    <line x1="138" x2="180" y1="90" y2="90" class="ln fm-flow" />
    <polygon points="188,90 179,85 179,95" class="ah" />

    {/* RED boundary box */}
    <rect x="190" y="42" width="286" height="114" rx="8" class="goldbox" />
    <DiagramIcon name="web" x={218} y={59} size={24} />
    <text x="238" y="64" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>RED · HTTP middleware</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>RED · HTTP middleware</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="204" y="86" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>R · Rate (requests/s per route)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>R · Rate (số request/giây mỗi route)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="204" y="108" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>E · Errors (5xx &amp; failed handlers)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>E · Errors (tỷ lệ lỗi 5xx, timeout)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="204" y="130" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>D · Duration (latency histogram buckets)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>D · Duration (histogram các mốc độ trễ)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Arrow RED -> Pod */}
    <line x1="476" x2="518" y1="90" y2="90" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="526,90 517,85 517,95" class="ah" />

    {/* USE resource box */}
    <rect x="528" y="42" width="352" height="114" rx="8" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="kubernetes" x={552} y={60} size={26} />
    <text x="574" y="65" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>USE · CPU, memory &amp; mutex pools</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>USE · CPU, RAM &amp; hàng đợi trong pod</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="544" y="90" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>U · Utilization (% CPU cores, heap busy)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>U · Utilization (% CPU bận, % RAM dùng)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="544" y="112" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>S · Saturation (CFS throttle, runnable Gs)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>S · Saturation (bị bóp CFS, goroutine chờ)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="544" y="134" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>E · Errors (OOMKill, dropped sockets)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>E · Errors (OOMKill, rớt kết nối mạng)</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="180" y2="180" class="rule" />

    {/* ---------- Row 2: Histogram vs Summary across pods ---------- */}
    <text x="20" y="208" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Cluster p99: Histogram buckets add cleanly; Summary quantiles do not</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Tính p99 toàn cụm: Histogram cộng gộp chuẩn; Summary thì sai số</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Left: Histogram (mergeable) */}
    <rect x="20" y="226" width="420" height="162" rx="8" class="goldbox" />
    <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={50} y={245} size={26} />
    <text x="72" y="250" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Histogram (sum by (le) across pods)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Histogram (cộng sum by (le) giữa các pod)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="276" class="m num">Pod A · le=&quot;0.01&quot;: 95  ·  le=&quot;0.1&quot;: 99  ·  +Inf: 100</text>
    <text x="36" y="298" class="m num">Pod B · le=&quot;0.01&quot;: 40  ·  le=&quot;0.1&quot;: 85  ·  +Inf: 100</text>
    <line x1="36" x2="424" y1="312" y2="312" class="rule" />
    <text x="36" y="334" class="b num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Sum · le=&quot;0.01&quot;: 135 · le=&quot;0.1&quot;: 184 · +Inf: 200</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tổng · le=&quot;0.01&quot;: 135 · le=&quot;0.1&quot;: 184 · +Inf: 200</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="362" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Exact cluster buckets -&gt; valid p99 quantile</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đúng tổng từng xô -&gt; tính chuẩn p99 toàn cụm</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Right: Summary (broken across pods) */}
    <rect x="460" y="226" width="420" height="162" rx="8" class="hot fm-glow" />
    <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={490} y={245} size={26} />
    <text x="512" y="250" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Summary (client-computed p99)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Summary (pod tự tính sẵn phân vị p99)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="476" y="276" class="m num">Pod A · 1000 req/s · local p99 = 12 ms</text>
    <text x="476" y="298" class="m num">Pod B ·   10 req/s · local p99 = 820 ms</text>
    <line x1="476" x2="864" y1="312" y2="312" class="rule" />
    <text x="476" y="334" class="r num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>avg(12 ms, 820 ms) = 416 ms (wrong)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Trung bình (12, 820) = 416 ms (sai lệch)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="476" y="362" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>True cluster p99 is ~18 ms, not 416 ms</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>p99 thật toàn cụm chỉ ~18 ms, không phải 416 ms</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>RED watches what callers feel at the HTTP boundary while USE watches resource pressure inside the container. Because Prometheus Histograms count raw bucket hits per pod, PromQL can sum those counters before interpolating cluster-wide p99; pre-computed Summaries lose request counts and cannot be averaged.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>RED theo dõi trải nghiệm người gọi ngay ở cửa HTTP, còn USE soi áp lực tài nguyên bên trong container. Nhờ Histogram đếm số request lọt vào từng xô le trên mỗi pod, PromQL cộng dồn được trước khi nội suy p99 toàn cụm; ngược lại Summary tự tính sẵn khiến trung bình giữa các pod bị lệch hoàn toàn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp17a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp17a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp17a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp17a text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp17a .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp17a .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp17a .body { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp17a .m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17a .r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gp17a .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp17a .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp17a .goldbox { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp17a .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp17a .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .gp17a .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17a .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp17a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
